2. Fixed Size Chunking with Overlap 

Concept 

Keep some words from previous chunk in next chunk. 

Code 

Python 

def overlap_chunk(text, chunk_size=100, overlap=20): 

chunks = [] 

  

start = 0 

  

while start < len(text): 

end = start + chunk_size 

chunks.append(text[start:end]) 

start += chunk_size - overlap 

  

return chunks 

  

  

chunks = overlap_chunk(text, 50, 10) 

  

for chunk in chunks: 

print(chunk) 

